-1+4t⟩\\cdot ⟨0,1,-2⟩ & =22 \\\\ 0(3+5t)+1(-2t)+(-2)(-1+4t) & =22 \\\\ -2t+2-8t & =22 \\\\ -10t & =20 \\\\ t & =-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, position vector $p$ of the intersection point $P$ is obtained by substituting $t=-2$ into the equation of the line, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}p & =⟨3+5(-2),-2(-2),-1+4(-2)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-7,4,-9⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the intersection point is $P(-7,4,-9).$" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338731 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338732 13194139535229 true] [17592186338731 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338733 13194139535229 true] [17592186338731 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338734 13194139535229 true] [17592186338731 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338735 13194139535229 true] [17592186338731 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338736 13194139535229 true] [17592186338731 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535229 true] [17592186338731 1041 "selection" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338731 1104 #edb/ref 17592186338732 13194139535229 true] [17592186338731 1110 #uuid "5bd20147-884b-5aad-8617-b8c00cdeb58e" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338732 1034 "(-7,4,-9)" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338732 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535229 true] [17592186338732 1111 #uuid "ad1f5c5e-9bfc-542f-b83d-9cd12da5c2e7" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338733 1034 "(3,0,-1)" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338733 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535229 true] [17592186338733 1111 #uuid "031f0ab7-98e5-5ef1-b694-26f424e0c1fa" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338734 1034 "(-2,2,-5)" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338734 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535229 true] [17592186338734 1111 #uuid "9a0767ba-c8fe-5d02-98cb-a2daad8cd428" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338735 1034 "(8,-2,3)" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338735 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535229 true] [17592186338735 1111 #uuid "b90c5c3a-2f79-5901-856b-ccae222540c1" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338736 1034 "No intersection" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338736 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535229 true] [17592186338736 1111 #uuid "c6e8c10b-4c6c-548e-8a40-af66b3fc3888" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338737 1017 #edb/ref 17592186338738 13194139535229 true] [17592186338737 1089 "q-108323" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338737 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139535229 true] [17592186338737 1100 "Find the intersection point of the line $l$ and the plane $Π$ with equations\n\n$$\nl:{\\begin{aligned}x=7+2t \\\\ y=3+t \\\\ z=1-t\\end{aligned}\\,\\text{and}\\,Π:x-3y+2z=12.\n$$" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338737 1113 #uuid "3b4368ee-9c42-51ca-8e68-cd3ecf43a30f" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338737 1145 "We can substitute the parametric expressions for $x,$ $y,$ and $z$ of the line into the equation of the plane immediately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x-3y+2z & =12 \\\\ 1(7+2t)-3(3+t)+2(1-t) & =12 \\\\ 7+2t-9-3t+2-2t & =12 \\\\ -3t & =12 \\\\ t & =-4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo get the position vector $p$ of the intersection point $P$, we substitute $t=-4$ into the parametric equations of the line:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x=7+2(-4)=-1 \\\\ y=3+(-4)=-1 \\\\ z=1-(-4)=5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the intersection point is $P(-1,-1,5).$" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338738 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338739 13194139535229 true] [17592186338738 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338740 13194139535229 true] [17592186338738 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338741 13194139535229 true] [17592186338738 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338742 13194139535229 true] [17592186338738 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338743 13194139535229 true] [17592186338738 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535229 true] [17592186338738 1041 "selection" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338738 1104 #edb/ref 17592186338742 13194139535229 true] [17592186338738 1110 #uuid "39c5cc2a-6c44-5296-ba70-0e923a5a0298" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338739 1034 "(11,5,-1)" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338739 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535229 true] [17592186338739 1111 #uuid "39aba5e9-0c9f-540f-b74d-16c2a40e488a" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338740 1034 "(1,0,4)" 1319413