ation of the plane, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r\\cdot ⟨4,3,4⟩ & =60 \\\\ ⟨3+2t,4t,-4+3t⟩\\cdot ⟨4,3,4⟩ & =60 \\\\ 4(3+2t)+3(4t)+4(-4+3t) & =60 \\\\ 12+8t+12t-16+12t & =60 \\\\ 32t & =64 \\\\ t & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, to get the position vector $p$ of the intersection point $P,$ we substitute $t=2$ into the equation of the line:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}p & =⟨3+2(2),4(2),-4+3(2)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨7,8,2⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the intersection point is $P(7,8,2).$" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338766 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338767 13194139535229 true] [17592186338766 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338768 13194139535229 true] [17592186338766 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338769 13194139535229 true] [17592186338766 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338770 13194139535229 true] [17592186338766 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338771 13194139535229 true] [17592186338766 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535229 true] [17592186338766 1041 "selection" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338766 1104 #edb/ref 17592186338768 13194139535229 true] [17592186338766 1110 #uuid "bdd9ea5c-674e-5100-b381-fa89099eac19" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338767 1034 "(3,4,4)" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338767 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535229 true] [17592186338767 1111 #uuid "8747eb3a-fc54-5776-8718-88e3f3f86e1b" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338768 1034 "(7,8,2)" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338768 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535229 true] [17592186338768 1111 #uuid "da77f2aa-64b5-5ca1-ac36-02ec2be0ec2a" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338769 1034 "No intersection" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338769 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535229 true] [17592186338769 1111 #uuid "bbdaedf4-03bc-5e84-8bce-25632aeb6b11" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338770 1034 "(7,2,8)" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338770 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535229 true] [17592186338770 1111 #uuid "317ddedd-6ce1-50d7-ac8a-6702106d586e" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338771 1034 "(2,8,7)" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338771 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535229 true] [17592186338771 1111 #uuid "fa623a79-e505-5608-88cf-de0b2ecb19f7" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338772 1017 #edb/ref 17592186338773 13194139535229 true] [17592186338772 1089 "q-33205" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338772 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535229 true] [17592186338772 1100 "Find the intersection point of the line $l$ and the plane $Π$ with equations\n\n$$\nl:r=⟨-1,-2,6⟩+t⟨2,5,4⟩,\\,Π:x+2y+z-33=0.\n$$" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338772 1113 #uuid "eaab1f60-24fb-5572-8cfb-474f418bf09f" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338772 1145 "Let's start by writing the equation of the line as\n\n$$\nr=⟨-1+2t,-2+5t,6+4t⟩.\n$$\n\nLet's also write the equation of the plane in the dot product form:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x+2y+z-33 & =0 \\\\ x+2y+z & =33 \\\\ ⟨x,y,z⟩\\cdot ⟨1,2,1⟩ & =33 \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨1,2,1⟩ & =33\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, substituting $r=⟨-1+2t,-2+5t,6+4t⟩$ into the equation of the plane, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r\\cdot ⟨1,2,1⟩ & =33 \\\\ ⟨-1+2t,-2+5t,6+4t⟩\\cdot ⟨1,2,1⟩ & =33 \\\\ -1+2t+2(-2+5t)+6+4t & =33 \\\\ -1+2t-4+10t+6+4t & =33 \\\\ 16t & =32 \\\\ t & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, to get the position vector $p$ of the intersection point $P,$ we substitute $t=2$ into the equation of the line:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}p & =⟨-1+2(2),-2+5(2),6+4(2)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨3,8,14⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the intersection point is $P(3,8,14).$" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338773 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338774 13194139535229 true] [17592186338773 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338775 13194139535229 true] [17592186338773 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338776 13194139535229 true] [17592186338773 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338777 13194139535229 true] [17592186338773 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338778 13194139535229 true] [17592186338773 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535229 true] [17592186338773 1041 "selection" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338773 1104 #edb/ref 17592186338774 13194139535229 true] [17592186338773 1110 #