gned}r\\cdot ⟨-6,5,4⟩ & =-24 \\\\ ⟨3-5t,2-6t,7⟩\\cdot ⟨-6,5,4⟩ & =-24 \\\\ -6(3-5t)+5(2-6t)+4\\cdot 7 & =-24 \\\\ -18+30t+10-30t+28 & =-24 \\\\ 20 & =-24.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe equation has no solution. Therefore, we conclude that the line $l$ and the plane $Π$ do not intersect." 13194139535229 true] [17592186338794 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338795 13194139535229 true] [17592186338794 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338796 13194139535229 true] [17592186338794 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338797 13194139535229 true] [17592186338794 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338798 13194139535229 true] [17592186338794 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338799 13194139535229 true] [17592186338794 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535229 true] [17592186338794 1041 "selection" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338794 1104 #edb/ref 17592186338797 13194139535229 true] [17592186338794 1110 #uuid "520d4b40-44ef-5cda-bca1-64895daa8f36" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338795 1034 "(-5,-6,0)" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338795 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535229 true] [17592186338795 1111 #uuid "fbe0c409-6b66-5562-8460-88b49d1631e7" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338796 1034 "(3,-6,7)" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338796 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535229 true] [17592186338796 1111 #uuid "b4cd441e-6b76-5604-b488-9f2f7b982c57" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338797 1034 "No intersection" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338797 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535229 true] [17592186338797 1111 #uuid "9edd9c5d-e4d7-5d63-86af-b2962ba7f512" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338798 1034 "(-5,2,0)" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338798 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535229 true] [17592186338798 1111 #uuid "95109580-9e46-5465-a314-e4bbaab31df2" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338799 1034 "(3,2,7)" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338799 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535229 true] [17592186338799 1111 #uuid "d4cda5ee-fd27-50ce-91dc-b978380a5df9" 13194139535229 true] [17592186338800 1017 #edb/ref 17592186338801 1319413953